WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand beside a wall and lightly touch it.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Place a foot to the ankle or calf (not the knee).

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Hands at heart.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe steadily.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
